---
// Home page: a short card that leads to the restaurants and cafés page, between companies and gifts.
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import photo from "../assets/restorani/suncokret.jpg";
---

<section id="restorani" class="pt-24 sm:pt-40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[40px] bg-white p-6 shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1.5px_var(--color-line)] sm:p-12 md:grid-cols-[1fr_0.8fr] md:gap-14 lg:p-16">
      <div class="md:order-2">
        <div data-reveal="photo" class="arch mx-auto w-full max-w-[380px] overflow-hidden">
          <Image
            src={photo}
            alt="Mali aranžman sa suncokretom, eustomom i amarantom u beloj vazi, na žutom stolu u bašti kafića"
            widths={[380, 570, 760]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 380px, 85vw"
            format="webp"
            quality={74}
            data-parallax
            class="arch block aspect-[4/5] w-full scale-110 object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="tag">Restorani i kafići u Beogradu</p>
        <h2 data-reveal class="t-h2 mt-5">Svakog petka, novo cveće na svakom stolu<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
        <p class="t-intro mt-6 max-w-[520px]">
          Pravim male aranžmane, ručno i od sezonskog cveća. <strong>Divlje i pune života</strong>, kao što cveće i treba da izgleda.
        </p>
        <a href="/cvece-za-restorane/" class="link mt-8">Cveće za restorane i kafiće</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
